From: OrientCOMPASS <316423573+OrientCOMPASS@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 31 Oct 2026 07:30:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] a2dp: declare AVDTP/A2DP version 1.3 in SDP records

N stock declares AVDTP 0x0102 (v1.2) in the AudioSink record's protocol
list and A2DP v1.2 in the ProfileDescriptorList.  Modern phones acting
as INT refuse such legacy peers outright: btsnoop shows Z40 doing
SDP(0x110B) -> AVDTP DISCOVER -> receiving 3 clean SNK SEPs ->
L2CAP DISC 9 ms later, looping, never sending GET_CAPABILITIES.
(When we were the INT the phone accepted passively, which masked this.)

Real headphones declare v1.3 (0x0103, delay-reporting era); AOSP O+
carries 0x0103.  Raise A2D_VERSION and both AVDT_VERSION definitions.
Side effect: incoming skip-SDP path now assumes peer v1.3, matching
every modern phone/PC; AVDT_VERSION_SYNC comparisons are untouched.
---
 include/bt_target.h        | 2 +-
 stack/a2dp/a2d_int.h       | 2 +-
 stack/include/avdt_api.h   | 2 +-
 3 files changed, 3 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/include/bt_target.h b/include/bt_target.h
index 2aba530..5a5288a 100644
--- a/include/bt_target.h
+++ b/include/bt_target.h
@@ -99,7 +99,7 @@
 #endif
 
 #ifndef AVDT_VERSION
-#define AVDT_VERSION  0x0102
+#define AVDT_VERSION  0x0103
 #endif
 
 #ifndef BTA_AG_AT_MAX_LEN
diff --git a/stack/a2dp/a2d_int.h b/stack/a2dp/a2d_int.h
index d4bb4c2..4e196f4 100644
--- a/stack/a2dp/a2d_int.h
+++ b/stack/a2dp/a2d_int.h
@@ -29,7 +29,7 @@
 /*****************************************************************************
 **  Constants
 *****************************************************************************/
-#define A2D_VERSION             0x0102
+#define A2D_VERSION             0x0103
 
 /* Number of attributes in A2D SDP record. */
 #define A2D_NUM_ATTR            6
diff --git a/stack/include/avdt_api.h b/stack/include/avdt_api.h
index e10faf0..9287c65 100644
--- a/stack/include/avdt_api.h
+++ b/stack/include/avdt_api.h
@@ -32,7 +32,7 @@
 **  Constants
 *****************************************************************************/
 #ifndef AVDT_VERSION
-#define AVDT_VERSION                0x0102
+#define AVDT_VERSION                0x0103
 #endif
 #define AVDT_VERSION_SYNC           0x0103
 
